@startuml sequence_diagram
autonumber

title Flower Shop -- Sequence Diagram: Admin Adds a Flower

actor Admin
participant FlowerController
participant FlowerService
participant AddFlowerCommand
participant FlowerRepository
participant NotificationService

== 1. Login ==

Admin -> FlowerController : POST /login {email, password}
FlowerController --> Admin : session set, redirect /catalog

== 2. Open Add-Flower Form ==

Admin -> FlowerController : GET /add
FlowerController --> Admin : show add_flower.html

== 3. Submit New Flower ==

Admin -> FlowerController : POST /add {name, color, price, stock}
FlowerController -> FlowerService : add_new_flower(...)
FlowerService -> AddFlowerCommand : execute()
AddFlowerCommand -> FlowerRepository : add_flower(...)
FlowerRepository --> AddFlowerCommand : saved
AddFlowerCommand --> FlowerService : done

== 4. Send Notification ==

FlowerService -> NotificationService : notify("CREATED", flower, email)
NotificationService --> FlowerService : ok
FlowerService --> FlowerController : done
FlowerController --> Admin : redirect /catalog

== 5. View Updated Catalog ==

Admin -> FlowerController : GET /catalog
FlowerController -> FlowerRepository : get_all()
FlowerRepository --> FlowerController : [flowers list]
FlowerController --> Admin : show catalog with new flower

@enduml
